GetStdHandle: extern function (id: @bit32) handle: ref unknown
WriteFile: extern function (handle: ref unknown, data: ref @bit8, len: @bit32, written: ref @bit32, overlapped: ref unknown) ok: @bit32
ExitProcess: extern function (code: @bit32) nothing
GetProcessHeap: extern function () heap: ref unknown
HeapAlloc: extern function (heap: ref unknown, flags: @bit32, size: @bit_native) memory: ref unknown
HeapFree: extern function (heap: ref unknown, flags: @bit32, memory: ref unknown) ok: @bit32
VirtualAlloc: extern function (address: ref unknown, size: @bit_native, kind: @bit32, protect: @bit32) memory: ref unknown
VirtualFree: extern function (address: ref unknown, size: @bit_native, kind: @bit32) ok: @bit32

STD_HANDLE_BASE: @bit32 => 0xfffffff6

GetStd: function (fd: @bit32) @bit32 => @i_sub_32(STD_HANDLE_BASE, fd)

STD_OUT: @bit32 => @i_sub_32(STD_HANDLE_BASE, 1)
STD_ERR: @bit32 => @i_sub_32(STD_HANDLE_BASE, 2)